ServerTokens Prod
ServerSignature Off
TraceEnable Off
FileETag None

Timeout 30
KeepAlive On
MaxKeepAliveRequests 200
KeepAliveTimeout 3

<IfModule mod_headers.c>
  Header always set X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
  Header always set X-Frame-Options "DENY"
  Header always set Referrer-Policy "no-referrer"
  Header always set X-XSS-Protection "1; mode=block"
  Header always set Permissions-Policy "geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()"
  Header set Content-Security-Policy "default-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'"
</IfModule>

Protocols h2 http/1.1

ProxyRequests Off
ProxyPreserveHost On
<Proxy "balancer://go-frontend">
    BalancerMember "http://127.0.0.1:8080"
</Proxy>
ProxyPass "/" "balancer://go-frontend/"
ProxyPassReverse "/" "balancer://go-frontend/"
